 nam CCTrap Support Trap callscctrap macro tcall CC$Trap,\1 endm** This psect contains what the linker thinks is* the code for the library reference.  The offset* is obtained from the offset table supplied by trapdefs.a.* The trapdefs.a offsets MUST match the order of the dispatch* table in the trapmain.a trap handler.* psect cctraplib_a,0,0,0,0,0get_cacr: cctrap CC$cacr rtsget_xttn: cctrap CC$ttr rts ends